ing ID | 200 + full DTO |\n| 5 | Get not found | Integration | Non-existing ID | 404 |\n| 6 | Auth required | Integration | No JWT token | 401 |\n| 7 | Forbidden | Integration | Wrong role | 403 |\n\n---\n\n> **Traceability**: Research Brief → Business Analysis → **Technical Spec** → Implementation\n> **Ready for**: `/wf_pre_openspec` hoặc `/wf_openspec` hoặc direct coding\n```\n\n#### Template for `validation_report.md`:\n\n```markdown\n# Validation Report: {{FEATURE_NAME}}\n\n> Kết quả review loop — kiểm tra chất lượng output của feature research.\n\n---\n\n## Metadata\n\n| Mục | Nội dung |\n|-----|----------|\n| **Feature** | {{FEATURE_NAME}} |\n| **Ngày review** | {{DATE}} |\n| **Lần review thứ** | {{ITERATION}} / 3 |\n| **Kết quả tổng** | {{✅ PASS / ⚠️ WARN / ❌ FAIL}} |\n\n---\n\n## 1. Source Verification\n\n**Status**: {{✅ PASS / ⚠️ WARN / ❌ FAIL}}\n\n| File | Check | Result | Issues |\n|------|-------|--------|--------|\n| `web_research.md` | Every claim has URL? | {{PASS/WARN/FAIL}} | {{list issues or "None"}} |\n| `opensource_findings.md` | Every project has repo URL? | {{PASS/WARN/FAIL}} | {{list issues or "None"}} |\n| `comparison_analysis.md` | Sources referenced? | {{PASS/WARN/FAIL}} | {{list issues or "None"}} |\n\n### Unreachable URLs\n\n<!-- URLs that returned 404/timeout — permanent failures -->\n\n| URL | Status | Action Taken |\n|-----|--------|-------------|\n| {{url}} | {{404 / timeout / paywall}} | {{Marked [ARCHIVED] / Removed / Re-searched}} |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Consistency\n\n**Status**: {{✅ PASS / ⚠️ WARN / ❌ FAIL}}\n\n| Cross-reference | Aligned? | Issues |\n|----------------|:---:|--------|\n| business_analysis UCs ↔ technical_spec APIs | {{✅/❌}} | {{details or "Aligned"}} |\n| Entities in BA ↔ ERD in tech spec | {{✅/❌}} | {{details or "Aligned"}} |\n| Screen flow ↔ Use case flows | {{✅/❌}} | {{details or "Aligned"}} |\n| comparison_analysis recommendations ↔ tech spec choices | {{✅/❌}} | {{details or "Aligned"}} |\n\n---\n\n## 3. Completene